a. UPTD PPA;
b. Women and Children Protection Forum;
c. Village/Sub-district Women and Children Protection Group; and
d. Other women protection and empowerment institutions in accordance with the provisions of laws and regulations.

Article 11
(1) Services are implemented to fulfill the rights of women victims and are carried out with the following principles: a. respect for human rights;
b. non-discrimination;
c. confidentiality;
d. empathy;
e. inclusion;
f. empowerment;
g. victim-based decisions;
h. honesty;
i. professionalism;
j. integration; and
k. sustainability.
